From: panvk-kbase-android worker <panvk-worker@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH csf-v11 185] panvk: hide VK_EXT_present_timing unless PANVK_PRESENT_TIMING=1
Generated-by: LLM

DXVK 3.x and vkd3d-proton 3.x query past presentation timings through
VK_EXT_present_timing. Under Hangover Wine 11.16 on Termux:X11, Red Dead
Redemption (vkd3d-proton 3.0.1 + DXVK 3.1.1 dxgi) faulted inside
vkGetPastPresentationTimingEXT right after creating its swapchain
("err:vulkan:vkGetPastPresentationTimingEXT Exception 0xc0000005 in Unix
call") and exited with ACCESS_VIOLATION. Keep the extension hidden by
default; the translation layers fall back to their own frame statistics.
PANVK_PRESENT_TIMING=1 exposes it again. No biblioklept workarounds in the
WSI code itself; the root cause in the X11 present-timing path is still to
be found.

Tested GPU: Mali-G615 MC2 (OPPO CPH2763, MT6878)
Tested Kbase UAPI: 1.21
Dependencies: csf-v11/183

diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
index f44d08d..0132382 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
@@ -12,6 +12,7 @@
 #include <sys/sysmacros.h>
 
 #include "git_sha1.h"
+#include "util/u_debug.h"
 
 #include "vk_android.h"
 #include "vk_device.h"
@@ -203,8 +204,14 @@ panvk_per_arch(get_physical_device_extensions)(
       .EXT_pipeline_creation_feedback = true,
       .EXT_pipeline_robustness = true,
 #ifdef PANVK_USE_WSI_PLATFORM
-	  .EXT_present_timing =
-         device->kmod.dev->props.gpu_can_query_timestamp,
+      /* DXVK 3.x and vkd3d-proton 3.x query past presentation timings through
+       * this extension; under Wine (Termux:X11) vkGetPastPresentationTimingEXT
+       * faults in the X11 WSI and the game exits with ACCESS_VIOLATION.  Keep
+       * it hidden unless PANVK_PRESENT_TIMING=1; the translation layers fall
+       * back to their own frame statistics. */
+      .EXT_present_timing =
+         device->kmod.dev->props.gpu_can_query_timestamp &&
+         debug_get_bool_option("PANVK_PRESENT_TIMING", false),
 #endif
       .EXT_private_data = true,
       .EXT_primitive_topology_list_restart = true,
